      <slug></slug>
      <title>Introduction to Sinatra</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Ruby and Rails</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://sinatra.rubyforge.org/&#34;&gt;Sinatra&lt;/a&gt; is a Domain Specific Language(DSL) for quickly creating web-applications in ruby. It keeps a minimal feature set, leaving the developer to use the tools that best suit them and their application.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;With Sinatra you can build a web application in a single file, which makes it fun and easy to use.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2691">Koen Van der Auwera</person>
      </persons>
